n that he heard in regards to  ant-man 3 and its starting production  and charles murphy says as of now  ant-man 3 has been rescheduled to begin  production in  june of 2021 in atlanta  so that's just a little less than a year  away from now  and as far as when to expect the actual  film hitting theaters if everything goes  back to normal  he says ant-man 3 has not been canceled  and  is absolutely still in the plans if by  some miracle  everything stays on track and long-term  shutdowns are avoided  we could see ant-man 3 in theaters late  2022 or  early 2023 which is kind of great news  because obviously we have to get through  marvel's phase four before we go on to  the projects that are not a part of  phase four so  late 2022 or early 2023 is pretty good  news for the ant-man fans  and speaking of some good news we have a  plot leak for ant-man 3 today  now this plot leak was discovered by  screengeek.com and like with all leaks  they could be true or they may not be  true so  take it with a grain of salt but as most  of you know we have discovered many true  plot leaks  on my channel including some for  avengers infinity war and  avengers endgame you never know but  let's dive into this ant-man 3 plot leak  so it starts off by saying ant-man 3  will be about  cassie leaving her family to be an  avenger with scott and hope trying to  stop her  now this is something that's actually  been brought up several different times  now in ant-man and the wasp  we saw a young cassie who wanted to be a  superhero she wanted to help her father  fight crime now of course obviously she  was too young at that point in time but  then in avengers in-game we see  a more grown up cassie lane  [Music]  now this adds up with everything that  we've heard before about cassie lang  what we've heard in the past is that  cassie now wants to be a superhero  following in her father's footsteps but  her father  and hope do not want to let her  obviously as any good parents would not  let their children go out and take on  super villains but apparently this movie  is going to be about her  kind of running away from them going to  be an avenger and them trying to stop  her now of course cassie is not going to  initially go on to join  the normal avengers she's going to join  the young avengers and in the comics she  plays a pretty important role on the  team of the young avengers as  stature now it sounds like we could be  getting a little bit of the story from  the comics in the comics her parents  really don't want her to have anything  to do with the avengers but cassie  idolizes the heroes especially after  watching her father as ant-man but she  begins to experiment with some pym  particles that she takes from her father  cassie plans on escaping and running  away to join marvel's runaways but then  she discovers the young avengers and she  would eventually go on to join  them so it definitely sounds like  ant-man 3 will set  up the young avengers with cassie going  off on her own trying to be a superhero  then maybe by the end of the movie  figuring out that there is a young  avengers team after all we do have  wiccan  and speed the daughter of wanda and  vision coming in the one division series  we have kate bishop coming in to take on  the mantle of hawkeye  everyone expects iron lad to come in  then there's hulkling and of course we  know about miss marvel  so the young avengers team is there  they're going to come into the mcu it's  only a matter of time and it looks like  ant-man 3 is going to be one of the  films that set that team up so  in ant-man 3 we're going to have cassie  lang run off and try to be a hero  on her own but of course she's going to  need help from her father  scott lang aka ant-man and janet van  dyne  the wasp cassie will most likely get in  over her head and then of course ant-man  and the wasp are gonna have to come in  and help and speaking of them  needing to help her they do talk about  the villain in this league as well  they say that as far as the leak goes  the villain of ant-man 3  is modoc and if you're unfamiliar with  who he is he was once  george tarleton a man of unspectacular  intelligence who was used by the  terrorist organization  aim or aim which stands for advanced  idea mechanics and he was used in  experiments to enhance  mental powers and modoc is actually an  acronym that stands for mental organism  designed  only for killing now there are some  really important things to note here  about this villain  and about aim we have had several rumors  that modoc  will be entering the mcu pretty soon and  it just so happens that the director and  screenwriters for ant-man 3  have publicly stated their interest in  having him in the film  and aim already exists in the mcu and  this is the really important part  because we have it in the past in the  mcu in phase two and we've actually  already seen it in phase four  in a trailer now if you recall back in  iron man 3 back in phase 2 they  mentioned  aim aldrich killian was actually running  that faction  and of course if you've seen the movie  you know that they've already begun to  do  experiments on actual individuals all  the way back then  so aim has existed in the marvel  cinematic universe for  several years now and we know that  marvel loves to tie  everything back together marvel plans  ahead  years and years in advance and they  plant seeds very early on that finally  sprout  later on years later so they're  definitely going to be referencing these  events of iron  man 2 plus not to mention the mandarin  the real mandarin is coming in shang chi  and the legend of the 10 rings and of  course we had that fake mandarin in iron  man 3 as well  so ant-man and the wasp are definitely  going to have some call backs to iron  man  3. and as i mentioned before we've  actually seen aim  in a phase 4 project already because  we've seen  aim in one of the trailers for black  widow it's in the final trailer for  black widow or what they were calling  the final trailer at the time as we know  that there are actually two more  trailers coming relatively soon but it's  in the scene where yelena belova  natasha's sister in the film is strapped  down to a table  [Music]  i should have come back for you so just  based off of the clip you probably have  missed it but it was actually charles  murphy who discovered it in the past  and he said through the magic of  flipping the picture you might see the  word  aim above elena's noggin this is almost  certainly  after the big final fight since she's  wearing the same  outfit and as you can see if we freeze  this picture and we take a look you can  see the words  aim right next to her and she also  happens to be on  an operating table and in this same  scene we see somebody about to give her  a shot  she also has lines upon her head which  lead people to believe that  maybe a face swap is happening here but  that's a video for another day  the point is we clearly see the word aim  right next to her in this scene and it  looks like  it's aim who's going to be operating on  her and whatever is happening here  confirming that aim definitely still  does exist in the marvel cinematic  universe so aim has existed  and has been doing experiments on people  since iron man 3  back in phase 2 and now we have proof of  them being  in phase 4. so this does clearly make it  a perfect setup for  modok to enter in ant-man 3. in fact in  ant-man and the wasp there was the  mention of a mysterious  benefactor and we never found out who  that was and marvel would not mention  somebody like that  just to keep him in the dark and never  explain who he was he's definitely going  to be brought into light and most likely  in ant-man 3 because they mentioned him  in ant-man and the wasp so many people  right now do believe that this  mysterious benefactor could be  modok and this is going to be the main  villain in ant-man and the wasp and  stature as people are calling